                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "Inside the toolbox\nis the carbon\ncopy, folded\naround a biscuit.\nThe valve was not",
                            "sold. It was sent\nfor inspection,\nwith the city\nretaining\nownership. Pip",
                            "puts the biscuit\nback. Evidence\nshould have\nstandards."
